Add maxDecompressionRatio guard against decompression bombs (CVE-2026-59873)

Backport of upstream commit 2812e9338665659b183aa7226518c307044957d3 to the
v6.1.x CommonJS source. Tracks compressed vs. decompressed byte counts while
inflating gzip input and aborts extraction/parsing when the ratio exceeds
maxDecompressionRatio (default 1000, set to Infinity to disable). abort() is
made idempotent so the ratio guard can't re-enter it.

